## Model card

- **Name:** Agnes 2.5 Flash
- **Short description:** Agnes AI's fast and efficient flash-tier MoE model — an upgrade from Agnes 2.0 Flash focused on coding task generation, debugging and refactoring, agent workflows, tool calling, multi-turn dialogue, reasoning, and image understanding; positioned for everyday development work with free access.
- **Provider / access:** Agnes AI (OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions at `https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1`, OpenAI Responses API, Anthropic-compatible Messages API); third-party gateways also route it (OpenRouter, AIHubMix); free tier ($0 in/out) with paid options.
- **Release / knowledge:** Generally available upgrade of Agnes 2.0 Flash; release context 2026; knowledge cutoff not established.
- **IDs:** `opencode/agnes-2.5-flash` (curated subject identity) / `agnes-2.5-flash` (live API model ID).
- **Context window:** 512K total (vendor docs; corroborated by AIHubMix catalog listing of 512K); max output 65.5K (vendor docs; corroborated by AIHubMix).
- **Modalities:** Text + image in; text out (vendor docs); capabilities include thinking, streaming, tool calling, web search, URL context, code interpreter, computer use, file search, memory tool, structured outputs/decision, citations, prompt caching, background mode, server-side sessions.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** Vendor docs: cached input $0.005 / input $0.05 / output $0.15 per 1M tokens; $0 trial. AIHubMix lists input $0.03 / output $0.15 per 1M — pricing discrepancy flagged (docs vs aggregator).
- **Architecture:** Agnes flash-tier MoE upgrade over Agnes 2.0 Flash (parameter counts not disclosed in reviewed sources).

